  "description": "OReole is a family of billion-parameter Vision Transformer (ViT) foundation models for high-resolution satellite imagery, pretrained using masked autoencoding on diverse, large-scale remote sensing datasets. It includes OReole-MR (medium-resolution, RGB) and OReole-HR (high-resolution, BGR+NIR) variants, with public release of models, code, and datasets planned.",
